Research method and original negotiation strategy:
Mehmet Onur Keskin, Berk Buzcu and Reyhan Aydoğan (2023).
Conflict-based negotiation strategy for human-agent negotiation.
Applied Intelligence 53, 29741-29757. DOI: 10.1007/s10489-023-05001-9.

The opponent model in src/cbom/model.py is derived from NegoLog V2's public
ConflictBasedOpponentModel. NegoLog was developed by Anıl Doğru, Mehmet Onur
Keskin and contributors. The maintained CBOM work also credits Emre Kuru.
