The negotiation strategy implements published Algorithm 2. Hybrid parameter
defaults and recent-difference weights also follow Berk Buzcu's public Solver
agent in HumanRobotNego (GNU GPL version 3), with attribution to the original
authors; other features of that project are not incorporated.
